# Graphify runtime caches (machine-local; committed graph assets stay tracked).
# The whole cache directory, not four of its members: `cache/semantic/` was the
# one part still tracked, and what it held was an extraction of a document tree
# this repository deleted -- 54 of its 73 source paths named `docs/active/` or
# `docs/reference/`. `graphify query` answers from `graph.json` without it.
#
# The four tracked graph assets are named by exception below, so a run that
# leaves new scratch behind cannot add it to the tree by accident: a bare
# `git add graphify-out/` used to pick up whatever intermediate files the last
# pipeline stage happened to leave.
/graphify-out/*
!/graphify-out/graph.json
!/graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!/graphify-out/manifest.json
!/graphify-out/.graphify_labels.json
